.labelle/
# flow_scanner writes generated `.zig` next to the `.flow.jsonc` source
# (the target's `scripts/` is a symlink back to this tree), so the
# emitted file appears here on every `zig build generate` and is
# regenerated every time — don't track it. Recursive discovery mirrors
# subdirectories, so the pattern must match nested output too.
scripts/flows/*.zig
scripts/flows/**/*.zig
